{"5082000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Why V Got AKs?", "steam_appid": 5082000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5169520], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHO CAN YOU TRUST WHEN EVERYONE'S GOT AN AK-47?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an Innocent and protect the Leader as a team or play as the Impostor, blend in, and eliminate everyone one by one. No voting, no meeting. Every player has the power to execute anyone at any moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROLES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innocent:</strong> Complete tasks, clear enemy robots, and protect the Leader at all costs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leader:</strong> Stay alive. Lead your team, make critical decisions, and complete the mission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impostor:</strong> Sabotage systems, create chaos, and execute the Innocents, especially the Leader without being caught.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082000/extras/862fa49bbfb8eee3fab0653c96e12e21.poster.avif?t=1788291467\" width=800 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082000/extras/862fa49bbfb8eee3fab0653c96e12e21.webm?t=1788291467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082000/extras/862fa49bbfb8eee3fab0653c96e12e21.mp4?t=1788291467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WEAPONS &amp; ABILITIES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire Mode:</strong> Fire standard rounds. (Standard bullets won't damage aliens.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lasso Mode:</strong> Move quickly across the map or pull players into traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tornado Mode:</strong> Create a tornado that hurls your targets directly into environmental traps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082000/extras/35136fb8fef7715c5687fe130269a4fb.poster.avif?t=1788291467\" width=800 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082000/extras/35136fb8fef7715c5687fe130269a4fb.webm?t=1788291467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082000/extras/35136fb8fef7715c5687fe130269a4fb.mp4?t=1788291467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TASKS &amp; THREATS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While keeping the base operational (or quietly sabotaging it), watch out for hostile robots and map traps lurking at every turn. At any moment, everything can go sideways.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082000/extras/d6b69242b1d8e0e504588980e29241d4.poster.avif?t=1788291467\" width=800 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082000/extras/d6b69242b1d8e0e504588980e29241d4.webm?t=1788291467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082000/extras/d6b69242b1d8e0e504588980e29241d4.mp4?t=1788291467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHO CAN YOU TRUST WHEN EVERYONE'S GOT AN AK-47?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an Innocent and protect the Leader as a team or play as the Impostor, blend in, and eliminate everyone one by one. No voting, no meeting. Every player has the power to execute anyone at any moment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROLES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innocent:</strong> Complete tasks, clear enemy robots, and protect the Leader at all costs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leader:</strong> Stay alive. Lead your team, make critical decisions, and complete the mission.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impostor:</strong> Sabotage systems, create chaos, and execute the Innocents, especially the Leader without being caught.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082000/extras/862fa49bbfb8eee3fab0653c96e12e21.poster.avif?t=1788291467\" width=800 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082000/extras/862fa49bbfb8eee3fab0653c96e12e21.webm?t=1788291467\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082000/extras/862fa49bbfb8eee3fab0653c96e12e21.mp4?t=1788291467\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WEAPONS &amp; ABILITIES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire Mode:</strong> Fire standard rounds. (Standard bullets won't damage aliens.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lasso Mode:</strong> Move quickly across the map or pull players into traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tornado Mode:</strong> Create a tornado that hurls your targets directly into environmental traps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082000/extras/35136fb8fef7715c5687fe130269a4fb.poster.avif?t=1788291467\" width=800 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5082000/extras/35136